    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Meanwhile, peel the radish and carrot and cut them into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"4\" data-s=\"0\">4 cm</span> chunks</b>. Shave the sharp edges round with a small knife so they don't break up during the long braise. Squeeze the shiitake and halve the caps.</li><li>Tuck the radish, carrot, shiitake, chestnuts and jujubes between the ribs. Cover and braise on low for <b>30–40 minutes</b>, until a chopstick slides easily into the meat and the radish is translucent.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
