  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Uncover the pan and tilt it slightly. Spoon off the clear fat that pools at the low side.</li><li>Raise the heat to <b>medium</b> and simmer uncovered for <b>8–10 minutes</b>, spooning the sauce over the ribs, until it is thick and shiny and the ribs look lacquered. Move the vegetables gently so they don't break.</li></ul>",
